# SHA-256 of the body (the lines between the BEGIN and END marker lines, each with its
# newline) of an lsd.sh block that earlier package generations wrote. Such a block is
# recognised as ours (replaced on install, removed on uninstall) by exact content even
# without an ownership receipt.
# Format: <body_sha256> <label>
# No public data yet: entries are added only from a measured unit state. Never invent hashes.
